-- check/good: §6.4. The cap is on INFERENCE, not on the language: a `where`
-- clause the author wrote is the whole set (Rule U2) and may name any number
-- of methods. This is the annotated twin of
-- `check/bad/TooManyInferredConstraints.beni` — the same 65 methods, accepted.
